 thing is  gonna sell really really well there's a  lot of people that want to upgrade from  the iPhone 6 7 8 to one of these so I'm  gonna be doing a lot more tests with  this I'm gonna actually switch to the  iPhone 10 R for a week after using the  10 and 10 s for over a year now and I'll  kind of share my experiences with you  guys to make sure you guys are  subscribed make sure you guys have those  notifications enable so you guys don't  miss out on that and maybe we'll do some  camera comparisons as well this been max  max tech and I'll see you in the next  video

